ragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >56 STAGES GOING THROUGH THE ENTIRE STATE OF RIO DE JANEIRO, PARTS OF SÃO PAULO, AMAZONIA, SPACE, HELL AND EVEN HEAVEN! SAVE RIO AND SAVE MIT AIA! (29 CAMPAIGN STAGES, 21 HORDE MAPS, 3 GOBLIN MODE MAPS AND 3 DM MAPS!) (wow what happened! the game had 18 maps in the day early access launched, things change fast, it's TRIPLE the size lol)   </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOTS OF SECRET AREAS ON EACH LEVEL!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-COOPERATIVE AND DEATHMATCH ON ALL CAMPAIGN MAPS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-EAT PASTEL AND DRINK CANE BROTH TO GAIN HEALTH! IT'S SCATTERED ON THE MAPS!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REPLAY THE GAME WITH ROCKET JUMPING TO FIND EXCLUSIVE ROCKET JUMP SECRET AREAS! OLD SCHOOL 90S STYLE!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATTENTION : THE GAME WILL STILL RECEIVE CONTENT MONTHLY EVEN AFTER 1.0!</strong></p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "A BRAZILIAN BOOMER SHOOTER GAME MADE USING THE ID TECH 2 ENGINE! SHOOT, JUMP, EMBARK ON A JOURNEY THROUGHOUT THE STATE OF RIO DE JANEIRO, HELL AND EVEN HEAVEN! SAVE BRAZIL!",
